    Device-specific HALs that the framework must be able to talk to.
    Without this fragment checkvintf rejects the assembled images with
    "The following instances are in the device manifest but not specified
    in framework compatibility matrix".

    Every entry is optional=true: the framework must not require these
    vendor HALs to exist (assemble_vintf verifies that against an empty
    manifest).
-->
